# External actions (integrations) — consolidated plan

## Why one document

Older notes split **MCP parity milestones** (HTTP mirrors) from **integration product work** into separate plan files; the detailed **monthly invoice + email** specification lived in `.cursor/plans/monthly-supplier-invoice-outcome-mcp.plan.md`. That caused confusion about whether they were different projects.

They are **not** separate strands of work forever: **Outbound email/MCP tooling for invoicing is the first delivery under this epic.** This file is now the **single source of truth**; the retired filename is reduced to a one-line redirect (below).

