## Application-wide architecture: server = brain; UI + MCP = two faces

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **Brain** | **`server/domain/*`** + **`server/http/read/*`** + **`server/http/mutation/*`**. Persistence here. |
| **UI** | **`public/`** → **`/api/...`** only for behaviour that mutates rules. |
| **MCP** | **`server/mcp/*`** calls the same modules or **thin workflow** wrappers—not a fork of domain logic. |

**Current gap:** **[`public/src/modules/invoices.ts`](../../public/src/modules/invoices.ts)** duplicates **`periodsOverlap`** and under-warns (only **`status !== 'draft'`**). Slice 1 replaces that with server-driven **`preview`** fields so UI and MCP share one contract.

