## Slice 1 — Goals

- **No double issue for same billing month:** before **`createInvoice`**, reject when **any** invoice for **`contract_id`** **occupies** the calendar month (**draft or issued**) — same interval overlap rule as **`listSupplierMonthlyInvoiceGaps`** ([`supplier-month-gaps.ts`](../../server/domain/invoices/supplier-month-gaps.ts)).
- **Gap alignment (default strict):** commit requires **`(contract_id, month)`** in **`listSupplierMonthlyInvoiceGaps`** unless a narrow **`allowOutsideGapList`** escape exists. Gaps only enumerate **complete past months before current month** (“invoice prior month on 1st”).
- Use **workflow** naming in new modules; **`assert*`** naming reserved for tests; **`supplier-issued`** only where it matches [`Contract invoice_mechanism`](../../shared/api-contracts.ts) — not user-facing MCP copy.

**Overlap (plain language):** invoice **`period_start`…`period_end`** and calendar month **share ≥1 day** → that month is **occupied**.

**Suggested helper:** **`existingInvoicesOccupyingContractBillingMonth(contractId, billingMonthYYYYMMDDorYYYYMM, invoices)`**; callers pass **`YYYY-MM`**; normalise **`monthRange`** internally.

