## Slice 1 — Work breakdown

### 1) Shared helpers

- [`server/domain/invoices/period-range-overlap.ts`](../../server/domain/invoices/period-range-overlap.ts) — **`isoPeriodRangesOverlap`**; refactor [`supplier-month-gaps.ts`](../../server/domain/invoices/supplier-month-gaps.ts) to import it.
- **`existingInvoicesOccupyingContractBillingMonth`** (see Goals).

### 2) `mutateInvoiceGenerate` guards

- Before **`createInvoice`**: **`invoice_mechanism === supplier-issued`**, **`invoice_cadence === monthly`**, **occupancy**, **gap list** (strict + escape).

### 3) Preview quality

- **`days_billed`** vs **`calculateWorkload`** for draft (same idea as [`deriveInvoiceDaysMismatchWarnings`](../../server/domain/warnings/invoice-days-mismatch.ts)).
- Compose via existing **`buildDraftInvoice`** pathway as **[`readInvoiceDraftFromQuery`](../../server/http/read/invoices.ts)**.

### 4) Workflow module

- Example path: **`server/domain/invoices/monthly-invoice-workflow.ts`** with **`preview…`** / **`commit…`** (signatures **`contractId`, `billingMonth`, `today`, `previewFingerprint` on commit**). Reuse **`mutateInvoiceGenerate`** after gates.

### 5) Outbound + outbox

- **`DeliveryAdapter`**; **single To constant** initially; persisted outbox keyed by **`invoice.id`** or **`contractId+billingMonth`**.

### 6) Surfaces

- **MCP:** [`server/mcp/monthly-invoice-mcp-tools.ts`](../../server/mcp/) registering **`preview_monthly_invoice`**, **`commit_monthly_invoice`**; update [`bank-mcp-server.ts`](../../server/mcp/bank-mcp-server.ts) instructions.
- **HTTP:** Thin **`POST /api/invoices/monthly/preview`** and **`POST /api/invoices/monthly/commit`** (or equivalent under [`routes/invoices.ts`](../../server/routes/invoices.ts)) calling **identical workflow** exports.
- **UI:** Extend [`public/src/modules/invoices.ts`](../../public/src/modules/invoices.ts); remove **`updateOverlapWarning`** overlap math once **`preview`** returns occupancy.

### 7) MCP outcome backlog (beyond slice 1)

| Area | Follow-on |
|------|-----------|
| **`get_http_invoice_pdf_base64`** ID chain | Carry **`issuedInvoiceId` / attachment** from **`commit`** when useful |
| **Leave** book vs preview | Optional combined workflow later |
| **HTTP parity tools** | Keep for regression; instructions steer assistants to outcome tools |

### 8) Tests

**`npx tsc --noEmit`**, **`npm run test:run`**; overlap, occupancy, gap, fingerprint stale, MCP + route contracts.

